 "Чему равен периметр R?": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 242\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"110\" y=\"40\" width=\"264.0\" height=\"168.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"110.0\" y1=\"107.2\" x2=\"374.0\" y2=\"107.2\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"225.2\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"225.2\" y2=\"107.2\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"162.8\" y1=\"107.2\" x2=\"162.8\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"215.6\" y1=\"107.2\" x2=\"215.6\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"268.4\" y1=\"107.2\" x2=\"268.4\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"321.2\" y1=\"107.2\" x2=\"321.2\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"31.2\" y1=\"124.0\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"31.2\" y1=\"124.0\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"110.0\" cy=\"40.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"225.2\" cy=\"40.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"374.0\" cy=\"40.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"110.0\" cy=\"107.2\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"374.0\" cy=\"107.2\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"31.2\" cy=\"124.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"110.0\" cy=\"208.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"374.0\" cy=\"208.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"162.8\" cy=\"107.2\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"215.6\" cy=\"107.2\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"268.4\" cy=\"107.2\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"321.2\" cy=\"107.2\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"162.8\" cy=\"208.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"215.6\" cy=\"208.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"268.4\" cy=\"208.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"321.2\" cy=\"208.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/><text x=\"167.6\" y=\"80.6\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">A</text><text x=\"299.6\" y=\"80.6\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">B</text><text x=\"80.0\" y=\"130.0\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">T</text><text x=\"136.4\" y=\"164.6\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">R</text></svg><figcaption>Рисунок условия. Сверху — A и B (вместе — прямоугольник), снизу — пять равных R; слева к фигуре целиком приклеен равнобедренный треугольник T остриём влево.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Значит, у периметра фигуры и периметра T есть общий кусок": "<figure class=\"fx\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 242\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"110\" y=\"40\" width=\"264.0\" height=\"168.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"110.0\" y1=\"107.2\" x2=\"374.0\" y2=\"107.2\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"225.2\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"225.2\" y2=\"107.2\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"162.8\" y1=\"107.2\" x2=\"162.8\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"215.6\" y1=\"107.2\" x2=\"215.6\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"268.4\" y1=\"107.2\" x2=\"268.4\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"321.2\" y1=\"107.2\" x2=\"321.2\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"31.2\" y1=\"124.0\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"var(--gold)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"31.2\" y1=\"124.0\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"var(--gold)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"110.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"var(--blue)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 6\"/><g class=\"sl\" style=\"--to:translate(264.0px,0);--d:.6s\"><line x1=\"110.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"var(--blue)\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"54.6\" y=\"86.0\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">x</text><text x=\"54.6\" y=\"180.0\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">x</text><text x=\"128.0\" y=\"158.0\" fill=\"var(--blue)\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">5k</text><text x=\"394.0\" y=\"129.0\" fill=\"var(--blue)\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">5k</text><text x=\"167.6\" y=\"80.6\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">A</text><text x=\"299.6\" y=\"80.6\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">B</text></svg><figcaption>Золотые боковые стороны T лежат на контуре фигуры — они входят в оба периметра. Синее основание (5k) спрятано внутри фигуры, но правая стена — ровно такой же длины: основание «переезжает» на неё. Поэтому общий кусок — две стороны x и отрезок 5k — стоит в обоих периметрах.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Каждый данный периметр — обход контура.": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='0 0 430 246' role='img' aria-label='Контур T'><g stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none'><rect x='110' y='40' width='264' height='168'/><line x1='110' y1='107.2' x2='374' y2='107.2'/><line x1='225.2' y1='40' x2='225.2' y2='107.2'/><line x1='162.8' y1='107.2' x2='162.8' y2='208'/><line x1='215.6' y1='107.2' x2='215.6' y2='208'/><line x1='268.4' y1='107.2' x2='268.4' y2='208'/><line x1='321.2' y1='107.2' x2='321.2' y2='208'/><line x1='31.2' y1='124' x2='110' y2='40'/><line x1='31.2' y1='124' x2='110' y2='208'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='167.6' y='80'>A</text><text x='299.6' y='80'>B</text><text x='80' y='130'>T</text><text x='189' y='164'>R</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='3.5' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M110 40L110 208L31.2 124Z'/><text x='128' y='130' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>5k</text><text x='55' y='72' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.3s'>x</text><text x='55' y='190' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.8s'>x</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(1)</b> P(T) = 166</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='0 0 430 246' role='img' aria-label='Контур всей фигуры'><g stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none'><rect x='110' y='40' width='264' height='168'/><line x1='110' y1='107.2' x2='374' y2='107.2'/><line x1='225.2' y1='40' x2='225.2' y2='107.2'/><line x1='162.8' y1='107.2' x2='162.8' y2='208'/><line x1='215.6' y1='107.2' x2='215.6' y2='208'/><line x1='268.4' y1='107.2' x2='268.4' y2='208'/><line x1='321.2' y1='107.2' x2='321.2' y2='208'/><line x1='31.2' y1='124' x2='110' y2='40'/><line x1='31.2' y1='124' x2='110' y2='208'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='167.6' y='80'>A</text><text x='299.6' y='80'>B</text><text x='80' y='130'>T</text><text x='189' y='164'>R</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='3.5' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M110 40L374 40L374 208L110 208L31.2 124Z'/><text x='242' y='30' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>x + y</text><text x='394' y='128' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.3s'>5k</text><text x='242' y='230' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.8s'>x + y</text><text x='55' y='190' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:2.3s'>x</text><text x='55' y='72' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:2.8s'>x</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(2)</b> P(фигуры) = 386</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='0 0 430 246' role='img' aria-label='Контур A и B'><g stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none'><rect x='110' y='40' width='264' height='168'/><line x1='110' y1='107.2' x2='374' y2='107.2'/><line x1='225.2' y1='40' x2='225.2' y2='107.2'/><line x1='162.8' y1='107.2' x2='162.8' y2='208'/><line x1='215.6' y1='107.2' x2='215.6' y2='208'/><line x1='268.4' y1='107.2' x2='268.4' y2='208'/><line x1='321.2' y1='107.2' x2='321.2' y2='208'/><line x1='31.2' y1='124' x2='110' y2='40'/><line x1='31.2' y1='124' x2='110' y2='208'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='167.6' y='80'>A</text><text x='299.6' y='80'>B</text><text x='80' y='130'>T</text><text x='189' y='164'>R</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='3.5' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M110 40L374 40L374 107.2L110 107.2Z'/><text x='242' y='30' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>x + y</text><text x='394' y='78' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='18' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.3s'>2k</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(3)</b> P(A и B) = 276</p></div></div><figcaption>Три данных контура — три уравнения. В обходе всей фигуры основания T нет: оно внутри, а вместо него идёт правая стена той же длины 5k. Поэтому (1) и (2) делят общий хвост 5k + 2x.</figcaption></figure>"
